    #Story 2 Start
    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/12_story_2.png"
    "Story 2: Familiar Impression"
    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/13_establishing_shot.png"
    "With several units in tow, the captain and his army march for the enemy camp."
    "Their goal is to annihilate the enemy—and, if possible, locate the missing boy."
    captain "Alpha Team, proceed to Point B as planned."
    captain "Charlie Team, scout the enemy numbers from the west."
    "As always, his orders are cautious; the safety of his men his overriding concern."

    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/14_panicked.png"
    "The victims of the war run from the inpending death..."
    "The village is done for!"
    "Just keep going!"
    "Run! RUUUN!"
    "My son... Where is my son...?"

    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/15_captain.png"    
    captain "Alpha Team, we'll soon arrive at Point D."
    captain "We'll prepare there and await further situation reports."
    "The captain and his men soon arrive at the enemy camp."
    "As planned, another team initiates a feint attack to draw attention."
    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/16_captain_1.png"
    "Cautiously, the captain moves into the enemy camp."
    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/17_enemy_corpse.png"
    "After a moment, he locates the bloodied corpse of the enemy commander."
    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/18_enemy_corpse_1.png"
    "A familiar blade protrudes from a hole in his chest."
    "He knows this sword—the missing boy had pointed it at him the night before."
    "But the boy is nowhere to be found, and the captain knows he is in grave danger."
    "He stares at the scene before him and whispers,"
    "Have I failed again?"
    # Story End
    
