    #Story 3 Start
    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/19_story_3.png"
    "Story 3: I'm Glad You Survived"

    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/20_establishing.png"
    "Years ago, the cowardly captain was but a meager foot soldier."
    "He possessed the arrogance of youth, and often butted heads with his commanders."
    "After one intense battle, he found himself searching for any surviving comrades."

    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/21_finding_corpse.png"
    youngMan "You're..."
    "The first corpse he found was a senior officer who used to bark orders at him."
    
    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/22_finding_officer.png"
    youngMan "...!"
    "The next, a fellow soldier with whom he often fought."
    "He had done this—he had ignored orders and brought his squadron to ruin."

    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/23_finding_captain.png"
    "As he cursed himself, he found a survivor: an officer whom he had often mocked."
    officer "Ah, you live... Good. That's...good."
    officer "I'm glad you survived..."
    "The officer closed his eyes, let out a final, blackened breath, and died."
    
    scene image "blackscreen.jpg"
    "This is all your fault!"
    "You're always so selfish!"
    "You killed all of us!"
    "I'm glad you survived..."
    "Those words would haunt the young soldier for the rest of his days."

    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/24_eight_year_later.png"
    "Eight years later..."
    "Though fearful at the thought of losing his men, he continued on as a soldier."
    "He now attempts to atone for his mistakes by ensuring no one else has to die."

    scene image "11_the_fourth_night/25_found.png"
    "Finally, he finds the boy wounded and hiding behind a bit of cover."
    "His heart skips a beat; it is like seeing himself some eight years ago."
    "I will do whatever I must to save him."
    "With that thought in mind, the captain reaches down for the injured boy."
    #Story 3 end

