    captain "Alpha Team, fall back once you've destroyed the enemy armory."
    captain "Beta Team, move prisoners to the camp. Charlie Team, return to base."
    "Suddenly, the boy on his back emits a small groan."
    "In a thin voice, he admits his error and apologizes for his selfish actions."

